![Three potential estimation strategies from participants. Many participants followed instructions to estimate ratios. However, some participants appeared to estimate the difference between stimuli pairs or submitted random values.](index_files/figure-pdf/fig-user-strategies-1.pdf){#fig-user-strategies fig-scap='Examples of participant estimation strategies'}
:::
